# Line endings.
#
# Git here runs with core.autocrlf=true, so it rewrites text files to CRLF in the
# working tree. tools/build.js writes LF. The two disagreed on every generated file,
# and after each `node tools/build.js` GitHub Desktop listed work/*/index.html,
# sitemap.xml and data/projects.json as modified even though the content was
# byte-identical — phantom changes that look like real ones.
#
# Pinning text files to LF everywhere makes Git and the generator agree.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never inspected or rewritten.
*.mp4  binary
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
